Hymn of the Maelstrom (5★ catalyst) for gcsim, from an unmerged gcsim pull request.

Source: https://github.com/genshinsim/gcsim/pull/3282 by Lou Chauvin, at commit fbea026 (2026-11-22,
        after "Remove unrelated changes"), based on gcsim main after "Add Starsealed Edict" (#3279).
Not reviewed or accepted by gcsim's maintainers yet: results with this weapon are experimental.

Only the weapon is taken: its folder (internal/weapons/catalyst/maelstrom) and its lines in gcsim's
weapon lists (catalog, keys, shortcuts "hymnofthemaelstrom"/"maelstrom"/"hymnmaelstrom", imports,
assets). The website files (ui/) are left out. One fix by this project: the Max HP and ATK buffs
used one shared stat array, and gcsim adds every value of a buff's array to the full stats, so the
healer also got the ATK bonus and the active character also got the Max HP bonus; each buff now has
its own array. No other changes.

This file is applied by scripts/build-gcsim.sh. When gcsim includes Hymn of the Maelstrom itself,
the build skips it and says so; then delete this file.

